  "notes": "USAGE: Functions as a noun and as a ⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ verb (おんぶ⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧).\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- おんぶ⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (to carry on one's back)\n- おんぶ⟦して→する：00392_suru⟧⟦もらう→もらう：00520_morau⟧ (to get a piggyback ride)\n- おんぶ⟦{紐|ひも}→紐：02251_himo⟧ (baby carrier strap)\n\nRELATED WORDS: {抱|だ}っこ (carrying in one's arms, front-carry), ⟦{肩車|かたぐるま}→肩車：16181_kataguruma⟧ (carrying on shoulders).\n\nIDIOM: おんぶ⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{抱|だ}っこ literally means 'piggyback and front-carry' but idiomatically means 'completely dependent on someone' or 'leaving everything to someone else'.",
